@direction LR
@spacing 60

(1 - A lead fills out your website form) -> [2 - Tag the contact website-lead so you know where they came from]
[2 - Tag the contact website-lead so you know where they came from] -> [3 - Save Website form in the contact's Lead Source field]
[3 - Save Website form in the contact's Lead Source field] -> [4 - Open the lead in your pipeline at the New Lead stage]
[4 - Open the lead in your pipeline at the New Lead stage] -> [5 - Text the lead right away so they hear from you first]
[5 - Text the lead right away so they hear from you first] -> [6 - Email the lead the same details plus a link to book a call]
[6 - Email the lead the same details plus a link to book a call] -> [7 - Wait one day to give the lead time to answer]
[7 - Wait one day to give the lead time to answer] -> {8 - Did they reply or book a call?}
{8 - Did they reply or book a call?} -> "yes" -> [8a - Move the opportunity to the Engaged stage]
[8a - Move the opportunity to the Engaged stage] -> [8b - Give the owner a task to follow up today]
[8b - Give the owner a task to follow up today] -> [8c - Text the owner that a hot lead is waiting]
{8 - Did they reply or book a call?} -> "no" -> [8d - Send a second text to a lead who has not answered yet]
[8d - Send a second text to a lead who has not answered yet] -> [8e - Wait two more days before the next follow-up]
[8e - Wait two more days before the next follow-up] -> [8f - Email a short check-in that keeps the door open]
[8f - Email a short check-in that keeps the door open] -> [8g - Give the owner a task to call the lead who went quiet]
